			"notes": "- when a chunk had to wait on a neighbour that wasn't loaded yet, the mod used to check back every 50ms on its own\nthread until that neighbour showed up. now it just checks again on the next main thread task, since the game processes\ntickets before running those anyway (ty [contaria](https://github.com/contariaa/standardizations) for the idea)\n- added benchmarks to the readme, vanilla vs the mod, with and without Lithium\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/arnnagpal/nether-order/compare/0.1.0...0.1.1"
